      "Hounds' Pursuit's theoretical total physical damage from Packmates only, assuming Naafiri has the maximum number of them active and Hounds' Pursuit is always ranked at the earliest levels permitted (ranks 1 / 2 / 3 at levels 6 / 11 / 16):\n  - Levels 6–8: 25 (+ 20% bonus AD)&emsp;/&emsp;The Call of the Pack 50 (+ 40% bonus AD).\n  - Levels 9–10: 37.5 (+ 30% bonus AD)&emsp;/&emsp;The Call of the Pack 62.5 (+ 50% bonus AD).\n  - Level 11: 60 (+ 30% bonus AD)&emsp;/&emsp;The Call of the Pack 100 (+ 50% bonus AD).\n  - Levels 12–14: 80 (+ 40% bonus AD)&emsp;/&emsp;The Call of the Pack 120 (+ 60% bonus AD).\n  - Level 15: 100 (+ 50% bonus AD)&emsp;/&emsp;The Call of the Pack 140 (+ 70% bonus AD).\n  - Levels 16–18: 137.5 (+ 50% bonus AD)&emsp;/&emsp;The Call of the Pack 192.5 (+ 70% bonus AD).",
      "Naafiri marks the enemy champion targeted by Hounds' Pursuit in order to gain assist credit on them, lasting for the standard credit timer.",
      "Hound's Pursuit's cast and dash do not break stealth.",
